TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution hydrothermal
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5
    pe 4
    C(4) 0.0005
    Mn 0.001
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0    1.0
        -m     1.0
        -parms 10.0 0.001
        -tol   1e-12
        -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -step true
    -time true
    -pH true
END
